        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To be, or not to be, that is the question.</i><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>But choosing to be a cheated man jumping into the river or a hunter seeking revenge is not a question worth considering.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《The Cheated Man's Revenge: Triple the Payback》 is a visual novel game. Players will take on the role of the protagonist, Liu Jieyun, an ordinary office worker betrayed in both career and love. After losing his girlfriend and job position to a rival, he embarks on a thrilling revenge plan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Detailed Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 《The Cheated Man's Revenge》, you will immerse yourself in a modern urban story filled with conspiracy and betrayal. The protagonist is a diligent and hardworking employee who was on the verge of being promoted to market department manager, only to have his opportunity snatched by Zhao Wei, a newly hired rich second-generation with a powerful background. To make matters worse, his girlfriend from university, Tang Zhu, is seduced by Zhao Wei and ruthlessly abandons him. At his lowest point, the protagonist resolves to fight back, teaming up with allies to meticulously plan a breathtaking revenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liu Jieyun (Protagonist)</strong>: An ordinary employee in the marketing department of Manli Culture Co., Ltd., diligent but lacking confidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zhao Wei</strong>: Formerly a new employee in the marketing department, now the marketing department manager. Arrogant and domineering, he stole Liu Jieyun’s position and girlfriend.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772330/extras/f5c659ccc004f52b20d23f0c348982fa.poster.avif?t=1779501620\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772330/extras/f5c659ccc004f52b20d23f0c348982fa.webm?t=1779501620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772330/extras/f5c659ccc004f52b20d23f0c348982fa.mp4?t=1779501620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Li Qingmo</strong>: A painter and Zhao Wei’s fiancée.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772330/extras/51af9fa4be9b4a1ec3c103288a1147d7.poster.avif?t=1779501620\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772330/extras/51af9fa4be9b4a1ec3c103288a1147d7.webm?t=1779501620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772330/extras/51af9fa4be9b4a1ec3c103288a1147d7.mp4?t=1779501620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zhao Mengmeng</strong>: Formerly a new employee in the marketing department, now the assistant to the marketing department manager.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772330/extras/0e2c8c0aa8ab0228e6bfbc040b56b370.poster.avif?t=1779501620\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772330/extras/0e2c8c0aa8ab0228e6bfbc040b56b370.webm?t=1779501620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772330/extras/0e2c8c0aa8ab0228e6bfbc040b56b370.mp4?t=1779501620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zhao Manli</strong>: General Manager of Manli Culture Co., Ltd.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tang Zhu</strong>: Liu Jieyun’s university girlfriend, who joined Manli Culture Co., Ltd. at the same time as him, working in the finance department.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Branching Storylines</strong>: Every choice shapes your relationships with romanceable characters and unlocks different endings based on your bonds with them. If all romanceable characters have high affection, you might trigger an unexpected outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visual Style</strong>: Main characters feature dynamic sprites and CG scenes.</p></li></ul>",
