ps/3772330/extras/0e2c8c0aa8ab0228e6bfbc040b56b370.mp4?t=1779501620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zhao Manli</strong>: General Manager of Manli Culture Co., Ltd.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tang Zhu</strong>: Liu Jieyun’s university girlfriend, who joined Manli Culture Co., Ltd. at the same time as him, working in the finance department.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Branching Storylines</strong>: Every choice shapes your relationships with romanceable characters and unlocks different endings based on your bonds with them. If all romanceable characters have high affection, you might trigger an unexpected outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visual Style</strong>: Main characters feature dynamic sprites and CG scenes.</p></li></ul>",
